description:
Replace simple deduplication in `OntologyService.searchClassesHybrid` with RRF fusion.

## Current Code (to replace)
```typescript
// Ontology.ts:670-675 - simple dedup
const seenIris = new Set<string>()
for (const result of [...semanticResults, ...bm25Results]) {
  if (!seenIris.has(result.iri)) { ... }
}
```

## New Implementation
```typescript
// Track ranks from each search
const semanticRanked = semanticResults.map((r, i) => ({ ...r, rank: i + 1 }))
const bm25Ranked = bm25Results.map((r, i) => ({ ...r, rank: i + 1 }))

// Fuse with RRF
const fused = rrfFusion([semanticRanked, bm25Ranked])
return Chunk.fromIterable(fused.slice(0, limit).map(r => r.class!))
```

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Uses RRF fusion instead of dedup
- [ ] Results sorted by fused score
- [ ] Existing tests pass
- [ ] Benchmark shows improved precision

